    {
      "text": "Fig. 7.1.1, 'Phases of implementation'. Five phases run left to right in nested shaded regions: DEVELOPMENT & SETUP → DEPLOYMENT → INTEGRATION & INTEROPERABILITY → SCALE → SUSTAINED OPERATIONS. Each region encloses the earlier phases, so each phase builds on those before it. A dashed loop labelled ONGOING/ALL PHASES circles the whole, marking activities that continue across every phase.",
